    <div class="meta">
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Board:</strong> ESP32 Dev Board or ESP32-C3</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Topic:</strong> Flash, RAM, PSRAM, PROGMEM, LittleFS, Compression</div>
